--   The Practice of the Presence of God: https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/13871
--   Power Through Prayer: https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/65115
--   Secret Power; or, The Secret of Success in Christian Life and Work: https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/33341
--   The Trial and Death of Jesus Christ: https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/21814
