    "days": [
      {
        "day_number": 1,
        "title": "Prayer for Sunday Morning",
        "content": "<p>Heavenly Father, thank you for carrying me through the night and welcoming me into a new day. Let my thoughts, words, and work honor you. Guide me by your Holy Spirit, guard me from harm, and help me care for those I meet. I offer this day to you through Jesus Christ, your Son. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 2,
        "title": "Prayer for Sunday Evening",
        "content": "<p>Merciful Father, thank you for guiding me through this day. Forgive the wrong I have done, and help me make peace where I can. Watch over my family and friends as we rest. Quiet my anxious thoughts, and remind me that I belong to you in waking and in sleep. Through Jesus Christ our Lord, amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 3,
        "title": "Prayer for Monday Morning",
        "content": "<p>God of mercy, I begin this Monday with thanks for rest and for the work before me. Give me a clear mind and a willing heart. Help me resist what is harmful, speak truthfully, and serve my neighbors well. When I cannot see the way ahead, lead me by your Spirit and keep me close to Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 4,
        "title": "Prayer for Monday Evening",
        "content": "<p>Father, as this day ends, I thank you for every good gift. Forgive what I have done wrong, and guide me to repair any harm I have caused. Be near to those I love, especially anyone who is afraid or unwell. Give us peaceful rest and renewed strength for tomorrow, through Jesus Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 5,
        "title": "Prayer for Tuesday Morning",
        "content": "<p>Creator of heaven and earth, thank you for morning light, for rest, and for another chance to love and serve. Open my ears to your Word and to people who need help. As I begin my tasks, keep me from selfishness and lead me in the light of Jesus Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 6,
        "title": "Prayer for Tuesday Evening",
        "content": "<p>God of compassion, thank you for being with me throughout this Tuesday. I bring you both my gratitude and the troubles I cannot settle tonight. Forgive my sins through Jesus Christ, comfort those who are distressed, and give me rest. Let tomorrow find me ready to seek your peace. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 7,
        "title": "Prayer for Wednesday Morning",
        "content": "<p>Lord of all creation, the new morning gives me reason to praise you. Thank you for the birds, the light, and the life you sustain. Guide my speech today: keep me from gossip, harsh judgment, and careless words. Teach me to tell the truth with kindness and to follow Jesus in all I do. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 8,
        "title": "Prayer for Wednesday Evening",
        "content": "<p>Father, Son, and Holy Spirit, one God, thank you for accompanying me through this day. Forgive the words I used badly and help me speak with greater care tomorrow. Shelter those who feel unsafe or alone. Let the peace of Christ steady my heart tonight and through all my days. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 9,
        "title": "Prayer for Thursday Morning",
        "content": "<p>Lord Jesus Christ, light of the world, thank you for the gift of this Thursday morning. Shine on the work before me and on the people I will meet. Help me act with patience and courage, especially when I feel uncertain. Keep me faithful to you and ready to do good. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 10,
        "title": "Prayer for Thursday Evening",
        "content": "<p>Holy God, Father, Son, and Spirit, thank you for your care today. I confess the ways I have fallen short and trust your mercy in Christ. Quiet my fears as evening comes. Give me a grateful heart, peaceful rest, and hope that reaches beyond this present day. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 11,
        "title": "Prayer for Friday Morning",
        "content": "<p>Heavenly Father, I place this Friday in your care: my work, my relationships, my hopes, and my worries. Teach me to delight in your Word and to walk in the way of Jesus. When I fail, draw me back to your mercy. Give me strength to serve you and my neighbors faithfully. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 12,
        "title": "Prayer for Friday Evening",
        "content": "<p>Lord, thank you for helping me through this Friday. Forgive the things I have done wrong and show me how to put them right. Be a refuge for people facing danger or grief, and give rest to those who are weary. I trust my night and tomorrow to your faithful care, through Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 13,
        "title": "Prayer for Saturday Morning",
        "content": "<p>Faithful God, thank you for bringing me to Saturday morning. Help me use this day well, doing my responsibilities honestly and treating others with respect. Guard my tongue from lies and my heart from pride. By your Spirit, lead me toward justice, kindness, and the joy of serving Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 14,
        "title": "Prayer for Saturday Evening",
        "content": "<p>Father, as this week draws to a close, I remember your kindness and bring you what I regret. Forgive me through Jesus Christ and help me begin again. Give rest to my body and peace to my mind. Keep those I love in your care and renew us for the coming week. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 15,
        "title": "Prayer of a Child",
        "content": "<p>Lord Jesus, thank you for loving children and welcoming them to you. Help me honor and care for the people in my family. Give parents and caregivers wisdom, patience, and kindness. When something feels wrong or unsafe, help me seek help from someone trustworthy. Teach me to grow in love and truth. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 16,
        "title": "Prayer of a School Child for the Holy Spirit",
        "content": "<p>Holy Spirit, be with me as I learn. Give me patience when a lesson is hard, courage to ask questions, and kindness toward my teachers and classmates. Help the adults who guide me to be wise and fair. Let what I learn help me love God and serve other people, through Jesus Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 17,
        "title": "Prayer on the Eve of a Journey",
        "content": "<p>Father, as I prepare for this journey, I place my plans and the people I leave at home in your care. Help me prepare wisely, travel attentively, and welcome the people I meet. Be with those traveling alongside me. Lead us in peace, and bring us safely where we need to go. In Jesus' name, amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 18,
        "title": "Prayer During a Journey",
        "content": "<p>God of Abraham and of all who travel, be with me on this journey. Guide my choices, protect those alongside me, and help me respond wisely to delays or danger. Care for my loved ones at home. Wherever I go, remind me that your presence is near, through Jesus Christ our Lord. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 19,
        "title": "A Birthday Prayer",
        "content": "<p>Heavenly Father, thank you for the gift of another birthday and for the people who share my life. Help me receive this new year with gratitude rather than fear. Teach me to use my time kindly, to grow in faith, and to trust that my life is held in the love of Jesus Christ. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 20,
        "title": "A Prayer for School",
        "content": "<p>Father, Son, and Holy Spirit, one God, be with our school and church community. Give teachers wisdom, students curiosity, and all of us the courage to seek truth. Protect those who feel left out or afraid. Help us learn from your Word and care for one another as followers of Jesus. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 21,
        "title": "Prayer When Going to Church",
        "content": "<p>Lord, as I go to worship, open my heart to hear your Word and join the prayers of your people. Help me welcome others and listen with humility. May our praise lead to acts of mercy and justice when we leave. I come to you through Jesus Christ our Lord. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 22,
        "title": "Prayer for Sincere Repentance",
        "content": "<p>Merciful Father, I have not always loved you and my neighbors as I should. Show me the truth about my choices without letting shame drive me from you. Forgive me through Jesus Christ, help me repair the harm I have done, and renew my heart by your Holy Spirit. Lead me into a changed life. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 23,
        "title": "Prayer for True Faith",
        "content": "<p>God of light, strengthen my trust in Jesus Christ when my faith feels small. Help me learn your ways, ask honest questions, and hold fast to what is true. Keep me from pride and fear. Let my faith show itself in patient love, good work, and care for those in need. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 24,
        "title": "Prayer for a Pious Life",
        "content": "<p>Lord Jesus, be my companion in the ordinary parts of life. Shape my habits so that I grow in honesty, generosity, and prayer. When I become distracted or discouraged, draw me back to your grace. Help me love you more deeply and serve other people with a steady heart. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      },
      {
        "day_number": 25,
        "title": "Prayer of a Patient",
        "content": "<p>Father of compassion, I bring you my pain and weariness. Give me patience for today and courage to ask for the help I need. Guide those who care for me, and stay near even when healing is slow or uncertain. I trust in the mercy of Jesus Christ and the comfort of your Holy Spirit. Amen.</p>",
        "references": []
      }
    ]
