    "title": "Courage, Compassion, and Calling: 27 Readings from Catherine Booth’s Life",
    "description": "Twenty-seven original, Scripture-led devotional readings inspired by Mildred Duff’s historical sketch of Catherine Booth: her childhood compassion, vocational courage, partnership, preaching, family life, service, faith in adversity, and enduring legacy. Each reading connects with a corresponding source section and includes historical context, reflection, practical action, and prayer. This is a new devotional adaptation rather than a full-text modernization or an independently verified biography.",
    "total_days": 27,
    "tags": [
