    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000332",
    "title": "With God in the World: A Series of Papers",
    "description": "The public-domain text of With God in the World: A Series of Papers by Charles Henry Brent, preserved across 12 original sections with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 35,
    "tags": [
