    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000383",
    "title": "The Believer Not Ashamed of the Gospel",
    "description": "The public-domain text of The Believer Not Ashamed of the Gospel by Edward Hoare, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 5,
    "tags": [
      "knowledge",
