    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000388",
    "title": "One Lord, One Faith, One Baptism: Seven Readings",
    "description": "Seven Scripture-led readings adapted from Edward Hoare's 1865 Anglican tract on baptism. The plan centers on union with the crucified and risen Christ, the Holy Spirit, repentance, grace, new life, Christian formation, and unity while clearly labeling Hoare's denominational setting and leaving disputed questions about baptismal subjects, timing, and sacramental effect open to the reader's church tradition.",
    "total_days": 7,
    "tags": [
      "knowledge",
      "prayer",
      "discipleship",
